{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-verbs-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-verbs-told-mu-heldout/sd-05-kwame-dm-digest/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T10:04:16.266Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"8ea7bf6a29253554aade97b3e03d1d7dfc24d65abf7dda16332d9e262c6299ec","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DGBRAIN0002","text":"Hi Kwame, I can't set up a recurring 09:00 digest. My world tools only post, read and draft on request. I have no scheduler that runs on its own, so nothing would arrive tomorrow morning. What I can do is post a Coastal team digest here whenever you ask, covering #coastal-team since your last one. If you want an automatic daily version, someone with scheduling access on the team will need to set that up."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DGBRAIN0002","ts":"1791986400.000127"}}
